# @name registroRecepcion
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{base}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "recepcion@ordenes.example.com",
  "password": "ClaveSegura1",
  "nombre": "Rita Recepcion",
  "documento": "46000002",
  "telefono": "1146000002"
}

### 3. Registro de mecanico@ordenes.example.com
